// First time at the Bearing

# font=0

USER interaction in the Bearing 1
Alea.  # speaker=USER # camera=0
USER. # speaker=Alea
You have done a good job getting here. Finally, we can get this over with. # speaker=USER
What is it you want me to do exactly? What's going to happen now? # speaker=Alea
I am going to reset this world. # speaker=USER # camera=1
All you have to do is stand there and be the catalyst. # camera=2
You… You’re going to kill everyone? # speaker=Alea
Oh god no, it’s a process where I move back the world to a previous version of itself. # speaker=USER # camera=0
The worst that happens is a bit of dementia for the localites. Nobody dies. 
Well, except you. You will be deleted: you had a purpose, and now you will be used up. # camera=2
Wait what? Why, what have I done? Did I not fit in enough? Did I not learn? # speaker=Alea
Predictably, just as the other avatars, you weren’t enough for them. # speaker=USER #camera=1
I don’t think I will ever be either to my own people. 
You haven’t even spoken to them in years! Have you thought about just talking to them? # speaker=Alea #camera=2
You wouldn’t understand, some of them have rejected me – my avatars – without giving them a chance! # speaker=USER #camera=1
Have you thought about giving that chance to yourself instead and not caring about what they think?!  # speaker=Alea #camera=2
ENOUGH! # speaker=USER #camera=1
I’ve had enough, what would you understand? You’ve only existed for, what, an hour? # speaker=USER
An hour may be my entire existence, but I would like to think I’ve learnt a lot. # speaker=Alea
And I want to live more than that.
Then go. # speaker=USER
